ai_response:
I do not have access to real-time information or current residential addresses of information commissioners as they are appointed on a yearly basis. However, according to rti act 2005, the following information can be accessed and disclosed by any person:

(1) names, designations, and salaries of information commissioners;
(2) number of information commissioners, not exceeding ten, as may be deemed necessary by rti act 2005;
(3) names, designations, and residential addresses of all information commissioners appointed in a particular year;

since the specific information requested is not available as it has not been disclosed yet, we suggest contacting the central information commission or the relevant rti bureau for more details on the current residential addresses.
